ech corpus. When the items are words, n-grams may also be called shingles.[1]  An n-gram of size 1 is referred to as a \"unigram\"; size 2 is a \"bigram\" (or, less commonly, a \"digram\"); size 3 is a \"trigram\". Larger sizes are sometimes referred to by the value of n, e.g., \"four-gram\", \"five-gram\", and so on.","topics":[],"score":213132,"global_rank":252721},{"name":"singh-karanpal/cookiecutter_exercise","owner":"singh-karanpal","html_url":"https://github.com/singh-karanpal/cookiecutter_exercise","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213131,"global_rank":252733},{"name":"puntara/Logical-expression-comparision","owner":"puntara","html_url":"https://github.com/puntara/Logical-expression-comparision","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Logical expression comparision","topics":[],"score":213131,"global_rank":252737},{"name":"nullconfig/ark_monitor","owner":"nullconfig","html_url":"https://github.com/nullconfig/ark_monitor","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213131,"global_rank":252738},{"name":"jack-diamond/blackjack-python","owner":"jack-diamond","html_url":"https://github.com/jack-diamond/blackjack-python","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"blackjack-python","topics":[],"score":213131,"global_rank":252739},{"name":"Cybergenik/entropy-calculator","owner":"Cybergenik","html_url":"https://github.com/Cybergenik/entropy-calculator","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Shannon Entropy calculator for any piece of text","topics":[],"score":213131,"global_rank":252749},{"name":"logantcrawford/Sensing-Python","owner":"logantcrawford","html_url":"https://github.com/logantcrawford/Sensing-Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Sensing Python","topics":[],"score":2131